window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Welcome to Hollywood Lakes, where the magic begins at midlife.</b><br> <br> When Shay's longtime crush takes her to an '80s movie marathon to celebrate her forty-fifth birthday, she's sure nothing can spoil their romantic do-over.<br> <br> But things get radical when the entire audience becomes trapped in an '80s mall—acting like teenagers and living out iconic scenes from their favorite films. Hormones and angst make for a disastrous first date, and Shay wonders whether Finn really is the one who got away . . . or if it's time to let him go once and for all.<br> <br> When the movies end, so does their chance to escape. Will Shay get back to the future in time to blow out her birthday candles? And will Finn be there if she does?<br> <br> <b><i>Witchteen Candles</i></b><b> is a blast from the past and a love letter to the '80s—with boomboxes, big hair, and an eternal flame.</b></p>"; 
